cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research software, please cite the associated research
  article when its final bibliographic details become available. Until then,
  cite this repository and identify the version or commit used.
title: 'K-Line Clustering and Regression (K-LCR): Bivariate Pattern Recognition'
authors:
  - family-names: Raskar
    given-names: Kirti
    affiliation: 'MIT Arts, Commerce & Science College, Alandi (D), Pune, Maharashtra, India'
abstract: >-
  Research software and experimental materials for studying K-Line Clustering
  and Regression (K-LCR), an approach for identifying heterogeneous bivariate
  linear patterns. The current research scope is pattern recognition; predictive
  performance is not evaluated.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/kirtiraskar1711-kpg/K-Line-Clustering-and-Regression-KLCR'
keywords:
  - bivariate pattern recognition
  - line clustering
  - clusterwise regression
  - ordinary least squares
  - perpendicular distance
  - K-LCR
version: 0.1.0
